 "source": ";; a: rest args, nested lambda, and the specform-1 split when the\n;; formals sit on the next line versus on the head line.\n(define add\n(lambda (x y) ; formals on the head line\n(+ x y)))\n\n(define add-broken\n(lambda\n(x y)\n(+ x y)))\n\n(define (make-adder n)\n(lambda (x)\n(+ x n)))\n\n(define (sum-all . xs)\n(apply + xs))\n\n(define (split first . rest)\n(cons first rest))\n",
